bove or below the season's mean in proportion to the other league's clubs; within its league a club stands (W% − ½ − f × Δ) ÷ ((1 − f) × n/(n − 1) + f) above its league's mean, f the share of its league's games that were interleague and n the clubs of its league; m 0.0245, the win share a point of strength is worth in the engine under 2013's rules. Every player of the club moves by one whole number and the best few of its lineup by one more, so nobody passes a teammate.","licence":"WAR: JEFFBAGWELL (Neil Paine), MIT. Names, birthplaces, clubs and ballparks: the Baseball Databank (Chadwick Baseball Bureau), CC BY-SA 3.0; its home games from Retrosheet. See public/baseball/ATTRIBUTION.txt.","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Neil-Paine-1/MLB-WAR-data-historical/1c8c3084d62112efdaa7054125af3cd01003e38d/jeffbagwell_war_historical_2025.csv","retrieved":"2026-11-10","rawScale":"WAR"},"map":"mlb2012","nations":{"124":[74,22,[["Russell Martin","C/3B",88],["George Kottaras","C/1B",72],["Mike Nickeas","C",62],["Chris Robinson","C",61],["Joey Votto","1B",92],["Justin Morneau","1B",76],["Brett Lawrie","3B/2B",80],["Pete Orr","3B/2B",62],["Jason Bay","LF/RF",70],["Jim Adduci","LF/1B",62],["Michael Saunders","CF/LF/RF",76],["Ryan Dempster","SP",75],["Erik Bedard","SP",72],["Scott Diamond","SP",72],["James Paxton","SP",68],["Jeff Francis","SP",68],["Andrew Albers","SP",67],["Jesse Crain","RP",85],["Jim Henderson","RP",73],["John Axford","RP",73],["Chris Leroux","RP",65],["Phillippe Aumont","RP",61]]],"158":[50,4,[["Wei-Yin Chen","SP",78],["Chien-Ming Wang","SP",59],["Chia-Jen Lo","RP",64],["C.C. Lee","RP",60]]],"170":[53,5,[["Jhonatan Solano","C",64],["Donovan Solano","2B/3B/SS/LF",69],["Julio Teheran","SP",80],["Jose Quintana","SP",79],["Ernesto Frieri","RP",77]]],"192":[77,20,[["Yasmani Grandal","C",80],["Brayan Pena","C/1B",70],["Kendrys Morales","1B",76],["Yonder Alonso","1B/LF",74],["Yuniesky Betancourt","1B/2B/3B/SS",66],["Yunel Escobar","SS",81],["Alexei Ramirez","SS"